+# ever reads is voyager-forecast-pipeline/web/*.json (written by
+# run_pipeline.py); this path used to be predict.py's own standalone CLI
+# default and got committed by accident once, producing a second,
+# demo-labeled forecast.json sitting in the repo that nothing reads.
+voyager-forecast-pipeline/outputs/
